88:Add to inspection (inspectionStore.ts:6-12): kind, storyId, duration, session: StorySession | null, userPlaying: boolean, suspend: 'none' | 'hidden' | 'context' | 'error', exiting: boolean. Keep every existing field and its meaning. inspection.playing stays and is the derived effective flag: userPlaying && suspend==='none' && status==='ready' && time<duration.
