100:advanceInspectionPlayhead is idempotent per stamp (state.clock.elapsedTime, identical for every subscriber in a frame). It clamps delta to 0.05 (as InspectionScene.tsx:98), advances entryElapsed always (entry blend, as :99) and time only when inspection.playing, stops at duration (hold, no auto-exit), and fires audio edge cues.
